OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786558734
OL,3,CParents of boy with rare blood
OL,4,Cdisorder urge people to become stem
OL,5,Ccell donors
OL,7,FThe parents of a 10-year-old boy
OL,8,Fliving with an extremely rare blood
OL,9,Fdisorder in Sussex say they are in a
OL,10,Frace against time to find him a
OL,11,Flifesaving stem cell transplant.
OL,13,FAlison and Peter Teare's son, Henry,
OL,14,Fwas diagnosed, in May, with aplastic
OL,15,Fanaemia, which causes the bone marrow
OL,16,Fto stop making enough new blood cells
OL,17,Fand platelets.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
