OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786558734
OL,3,CParents of boy with rare blood
OL,4,Cdisorder urge people to become stem
OL,5,Ccell donors
OL,7,FThe couple, from Haywards Heath, are
OL,8,Fnow working alongside the blood cancer
OL,9,Fcharity DKMS to raise awareness and
OL,10,Fencourage more people to register as
OL,11,Fstem cell donors.
OL,13,F"Certainly by signing up to the
OL,14,Fregister you're giving the chance, a
OL,15,Fsecond chance to somebody, whether
OL,16,Fit's somebody with aplastic anaemia or
OL,17,Fsomebody with another blood disorder,
OL,18,Fyou're giving them a chance of life,"
OL,19,FMr Teare told ITV Meridian.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786558734
OL,3,CParents of boy with rare blood
OL,4,Cdisorder urge people to become stem
OL,5,Ccell donors
OL,7,F"It's an amazing, unselfish act that
OL,8,Fcould be your defining, proudest
OL,9,Fachievement actually."
OL,11,FHenry was diagnosed after his parents
OL,12,Fnoticed he was appearing more pale
OL,13,Fthan usual and feeling breathless
OL,14,Fafter running.
OL,16,FThey eventually took him to their
OL,17,Flocal A&E department, where he
OL,18,Funderwent blood tests and it was
OL,19,Fdiscovered that his haemoglobin and
OL,20,Fplatelet levels were dangerously low.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786558734
OL,3,CParents of boy with rare blood
OL,4,Cdisorder urge people to become stem
OL,5,Ccell donors
OL,7,FHe was immediately transferred to a
OL,8,FHigh Dependency unit and underwent an
OL,9,Femergency blood transfusion.
OL,11,FHenry was later moved to London for a
OL,12,Fbone marrow biopsy, which confirmed
OL,13,Fthat he had severe aplastic anaemia.
OL,15,FHe is currently reliant on regular
OL,16,Fblood transfusions and hospital
OL,17,Fcheckups, and his family have been
OL,18,Ftold that Henry's best opportunity for
OL,19,Fa full recovery is finding a matching
OL,20,Fstem cell donor.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786558734
OL,3,CParents of boy with rare blood
OL,4,Cdisorder urge people to become stem
OL,5,Ccell donors
OL,7,FBut only one in three patients manage
OL,8,Fto do so - a statistic which is
OL,9,Ffurther complicated because just 7% of
OL,10,Fthe eligible population in the UK are
OL,11,Fcurrently registered as stem cell
OL,12,Fdonors, DKMS says.
OL,14,FMrs Teare told ITV Meridian that
OL,15,Ffinding a matching donor would give
OL,16,Fher son his "childhood back".
OL,18,FShe explained that, because of Henry's
OL,19,Fdiagnosis and ongoing treatment plan,
OL,20,Fthat he's "missed a lot of school" and
OL,21,Fis unable to regularly see his friends.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
