FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786558734
OL,3,CParents of boy with rare blood
OL,4,Cdisorder urge people to become stem
OL,5,Ccell donors
OL,7,FAnyone who is interested in
OL,8,Fregistering to become a stem cell
OL,9,Fdonor can do so by visiting the
OL,10,Fofficial DKMS website.
OL,12,FMost people who join the stem cell
OL,13,Fdonor register will never be called to
OL,14,Fdonate, according to the charity.
OL,16,FBut if you are matched to a patient,
OL,17,Fnine out of 10 times the donation can
OL,18,Fbe completed through a simple, non-
OL,19,Fsurgical procedure, similar to
OL,20,Fdonating blood platelets.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
